[' To achieve this task, I will provide a Java code snippet using Akka Streams for non-blocking processing, a configuration service (Apache ConfigFactory), and a logging framework (Log4j2). The hash generation is done using MurmurHash3 algorithm to minimize memory usage and CPU utilization.

First, add the required dependencies in your build.gradle file:

